        "id": "ch4_3-1",
        "text": "Exploring the Activities Overview\nThe activities overview area is what has replaced the Application menu system\nused in older versions of GNOME, and is what has made GNOME 3 so controversial.\nWhile it was designed to be easy to navigate around in, the overall structure and\nlayout can be confusing, especially if you\u2019re already comfortable using the old\nmenu system. This section walks through the three features of the activities\noverview \u2014 the dash, the windows overview, and the workspace selector.\nEsta secci\u00f3n contiene las siguientes subsecciones\n\u2022 The dash\n\u2022 The windows overview area\n\u2022 Working with workspaces\nSi deseas explorar cualquiera de estas subsecciones, puedes pregunt\u00e1rmelo directamente.",
